WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.994 --> 00:00:18.977
lunch, Mom went outside to weed the garden.

2
00:00:20.258 --> 00:00:22.179
Dad went to the hardware store.

3
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.722
Vinnie and Mandy quickly did the dishes.

4
00:00:26.902 --> 00:00:28.764
Then they ran up to the attic.

5
00:00:30.516 --> 00:00:34.978
"Our photo trips still feel like a dream to me," Mandy said.

6
00:00:34.998 --> 00:00:37.899
"Do you think anyone would believe us?"

7
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:39.380
asked Vinnie.

8
00:00:40.441 --> 00:00:42.061
He opened the attic door.

9
00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:44.522
Mandy shook her head.

10
00:00:44.542 --> 00:00:47.924
"No, they would think we were crazy."

11
00:00:51.546 --> 00:00:53.566
Vinnie picked up the photo album.

12
00:00:54.467 --> 00:00:58.316
He opened to the picture of Greece.

13
00:00:58.336 --> 00:01:02.500
"I wonder if Jason won his race at the Olympics," he said.

14
00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.242
"Where are we going now?"

15
00:01:05.882 --> 00:01:06.803
Mandy asked.

16
00:01:09.245 --> 00:01:10.586
Vinnie turned the page.

17
00:01:11.227 --> 00:01:13.048
The next photo was puzzling.

18
00:01:14.349 --> 00:01:17.092
The old man was standing beside a fountain.

19
00:01:18.152 --> 00:01:20.674
Behind him, frogs were glowing.

20
00:01:22.336 --> 00:01:23.397
"Where is this?"

21
00:01:24.177 --> 00:01:24.878
asked Vinnie.

22
00:01:24.898 --> 00:01:27.300
"We'll soon find out!"

23
00:01:27.932 --> 00:01:28.892
Mandy replied.

24
00:01:30.073 --> 00:01:32.554
The light forced them to close their eyes.

25
00:01:33.494 --> 00:01:36.736
The children fell down the deep tunnel once again.

26
00:01:40.557 --> 00:01:42.878
This time they landed in a tree.

27
00:01:42.898 --> 00:01:49.441
"Something's tickling my arm," giggled Mandy.

28
00:01:49.981 --> 00:01:51.742
It was a small red apple.

29
00:01:51.762 --> 00:01:56.664
"Oh, Mandy, I think I'm going to—," began Vinnie.

30
00:01:58.596 --> 00:01:59.817
The tree branch broke.

31
00:02:00.397 --> 00:02:03.439
Vinnie and Mandy fell to the ground—hard.

32
00:02:04.619 --> 00:02:06.280
Apples fell all around them.

33
00:02:07.621 --> 00:02:09.682
Someone screamed "No!"

34
00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:11.543
in a high voice.

35
00:02:13.204 --> 00:02:14.845
The children turned around.

36
00:02:16.106 --> 00:02:18.947
An old man was stamping his feet angrily.

37
00:02:18.967 --> 00:02:21.528
"Look at what you have done!"

38
00:02:22.149 --> 00:02:22.809
he shouted.

39
00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.671
The children quickly jumped up.

40
00:02:25.691 --> 00:02:31.069
"Look!" Vinnie said, grabbing his sister's arm.

41
00:02:32.229 --> 00:02:35.870
All around them grew different kinds of fruits and vegetables.

42
00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:40.191
Pear and peach trees were next to pumpkins on the vine.

43
00:02:40.211 --> 00:02:44.633
"How many apples did you ruin?"

44
00:02:45.313 --> 00:02:46.213
the man cried.

45
00:02:47.193 --> 00:02:48.974
He looked around in a panic.

46
00:02:49.954 --> 00:02:52.035
"His Majesty will be most upset.

47
00:02:53.155 --> 00:02:54.476
He won't stand for this.

48
00:02:54.936 --> 00:02:55.836
No, he will not."

49
00:02:57.220 --> 00:03:00.021
"We're so sorry," Mandy said.

50
00:03:00.041 --> 00:03:03.323
"My poor garden!"

51
00:03:03.923 --> 00:03:04.863
the man cried.

52
00:03:04.883 --> 00:03:06.464
"Who are you?"

53
00:03:06.484 --> 00:03:09.725
"We're—," Vinnie began.

54
00:03:11.146 --> 00:03:12.706
The man held up his hand.

55
00:03:12.726 --> 00:03:14.847
"I don't care!

56
00:03:15.047 --> 00:03:15.568
Get out!

57
00:03:15.888 --> 00:03:16.648
Leave at once!"

58
00:03:17.448 --> 00:03:18.169
he shouted.

59
00:03:20.089 --> 00:03:22.691
The children looked around for a way out.

60
00:03:23.751 --> 00:03:25.972
They saw the most amazing sight.

61
00:03:26.876 --> 00:03:29.817
A fabulous palace stood right in front of them!

62
00:03:29.837 --> 00:03:33.899
"Wow!" the children said together.

63
00:03:33.919 --> 00:03:36.860
"Where are we?"

64
00:03:37.661 --> 00:03:38.861
Vinnie asked aloud.

65
00:03:38.881 --> 00:03:41.062
"You little monsters!"

66
00:03:41.923 --> 00:03:44.084
the old man said, ignoring Vinnie.

67
00:03:45.424 --> 00:03:48.886
"I should—" But he suddenly became quiet.

68
00:03:49.546 --> 00:03:50.626
He bowed his head.

69
00:03:52.447 --> 00:03:53.928
The children turned to look.

70
00:03:55.228 --> 00:03:57.829
A group of men and women walked toward them.

71
00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:01.291
A man in a feathered hat was in front.

72
00:04:02.311 --> 00:04:04.992
He wore white stockings and long robes.

73
00:04:05.653 --> 00:04:06.713
He carried a cane.

74
00:04:09.034 --> 00:04:11.435
Vinnie could tell he was very important.

75
00:04:11.455 --> 00:04:13.496
"You, gardener!"

76
00:04:14.256 --> 00:04:16.857
The man pointed his cane at the old man.

77
00:04:16.877 --> 00:04:19.518
"What have you done to my apples?"

78
00:04:20.839 --> 00:04:22.860
The old man was very nervous.

79
00:04:23.632 --> 00:04:25.293
All he could do was mumble.

80
00:04:27.694 --> 00:04:30.495
"Excuse me, sir," interrupted Mandy.

81
00:04:30.515 --> 00:04:35.776
"I can tell you what—" There was a loud gasp from the group.

82
00:04:37.117 --> 00:04:39.798
Dozens of eyes stared at the children angrily.

83
00:04:39.818 --> 00:04:43.239
"How dare you speak to the Sun King!"

84
00:04:44.059 --> 00:04:45.200
one man scolded.
